# Required base image rows: calico-operator, calico, coredns, node-local-dns.
# Calico 3.33 consolidates calico/node, cni, kube-controllers and typha into quay.io/calico/calico.
# Fill only after rendering every pinned chart and resolving all operator-generated images.
# The reference must be repository:tag and digest must be the registry OCI manifest digest.
# Every archive must contain the exact reference and be verified on each target node.
